<p>Cargo builds and runs a project. A tag like &lt;b&gt;this&lt;/b&gt; stays plain text.</p>
<h2 id="your-first-program">Your first program</h2>
<pre class="code" data-lang="rust" translate="no"><code><a-k>fn</a-k> <a-f>main</a-f><a-p>()</a-p> <a-p>{</a-p>
    <a-k>let</a-k> name = <a-s>&quot;minisql&quot;</a-s><a-p>;</a-p>
    <a-kc>if</a-kc> name<a-p>.</a-p><a-f>len</a-f><a-p>()</a-p> &gt; <a-n>3</a-n> <a-p>{</a-p>
        <a-m>println!</a-m><a-p>(</a-p><a-s>&quot;hello, {name}! {}&quot;</a-s><a-p>,</a-p> <a-n>42</a-n><a-p>);</a-p>
    <a-p>}</a-p>
<a-p>}</a-p></code></pre>
<pre class="code" data-lang="rust" translate="no"><code><a-k>let</a-k> count<a-p>:</a-p> <a-t>i32</a-t> = <a-s>&quot;three&quot;</a-s><a-p>;</a-p></code></pre>
<pre class="code" data-lang="toml" translate="no"><code><a-p>[</a-p><a-pr>package</a-pr><a-p>]</a-p>
