<p>Read about <a href="/lesson/p01/02-variables#shadowing">shadowing</a> next, or the <a href="https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/">Rust Book</a>.</p>
<h2 id="your-first-program-2">Your first program</h2>
<p>Run it with <code translate="no">cargo run</code>, then <em>try</em> <strong>again</strong>.</p>
